{
 "id": "verse-43-15-5-folk",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/verse-43-15-5-folk",
 "offset_seconds": -1.960000000000214,
 "words_heard": 179,
 "words": 198,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The Father is the gardener who tends the vine with care",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He takes away the barren wood and prunes the branches there",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So every branch that bears its fruit will bear its fruit the more",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And we are clean already by the word he spoke before",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the vine; you are the branches",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever remains in me and I in him bears much fruit",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For apart from me you can do nothing",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remain in me, and I in you",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A branch can't bear fruit by itself, it needs the vine to grow",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It withers when it's broken off and lies in dust below",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But if you stay with me, he said, and my words in you remain",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then ask whatever you may wish, you will not ask in vain",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am the vine; you are the branches",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever remains in me and I in him bears much fruit",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For apart from me you can do nothing",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remain in me, and I in you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is how my Father is glorified",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That you bear much fruit",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And so prove to be my disciples",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Remain in me, and I in you",
